// ERROR: E1143
// ADR-0089 §3 cleanup: `break;` with no enclosing `loop`/`while`/`for` must
// be refused with its own E1143 code (Track B rule #1 — never panic on user
// input), not mis-borrow E1140 UndefinedLocal. Neither the parser
// (`E0006 BreakValueOutsideLoop` has zero construction sites — unreachable
// dead code) nor typecheck (`Stmt::Break` is a no-op) bars this; the
// lowerer's loop-context stack is the sole guard.
function f() -> Integer {
    break;
    return 0;
}
